    [module name=similar  gate=enforced reason='full graded-similarity impl complete + spec-faithful (ENFORCED, all 113 cases green): §2.1.1 operator scalar rules (identical=1.0, numeric/temporal exact-by-default + caller tolerance, atoms/bools degenerate, kind-mismatch no-coercion, null->absence channel), all 10 scorers on known pairs (damerau-beats-levenshtein transposition contrast pinned), ft-pipeline normalizers (fold-case/trim/stem/stopwords + stem-on-character-scorer refusal), §2.3 recursive comparison (weighted null-aware maps w/ purpose-relative weights, element name+attrs+children to depth, ordered alignment vs ordered=false set similarity, table=sequence-of-rows), the FULL §3.2 construct x kind matrix (all 40 cells: ~/cxpath/join/distinct/contains/sort/match/validate x scalar/map/element/sequence/array) + footnote negatives (degenerate atom/bool, exact pattern-arm beside graded when-arm, bare-predicate sort refused CXER4901), §5.1 join four types as filters over ONE labeled dataset + all 4 selection modes (greedy-trap matrix pins greedy-best per-left vs :optimal Hungarian 1:1), §5.2 clustering policies on an A~B~C!~A chain (t-closure/c-linkage/singletons + cohesion + rerun determinism), §5.3/§5.4 routing partition + resolutions resolver tier (verdict flip, score short-circuit, join integration, rerun determinism), decision-policy purpose-relativity, band-truthiness, 5 fn-doc corpus programs verbatim, 6 CXER4900 + 7 CXER4901 error triggers. Every expected output re-derived by running the real binary (single oracle). The authoring pass surfaced a :cosine float overshoot above the §4.2 closed [0,1] bound (1.0000000000000002 on identical token multisets) — the scorer now clamps, and case 024 pins the bound as enforced']
